  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Broad Spectrum Research and Strategic Advocacy to enhance Access to Health &amp; Justice (Project BRASA). Project BRASA reflects the UN&apos;s commitment to leaving no one behind by strengthening the current gender-based violence architecture through innovation, strategic alliances, research and effective support mechanisms.</narrative>
